// Counter Contract - Locking Script
// State: [count] (serialized after OP_RETURN)
//
// This contract verifies the preimage and ensures the
// spending transaction preserves the UTXO value.

// Verify preimage authenticity (OP_PUSH_TX)
checkPreimage

// Extract the input amount and verify it's preserved
dup
extractAmount
0 greaterThan
verify

// Script succeeds - the chain engine validates state transitions
drop
true
